{title: Mishri}
{artist: Anuv Jain}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Yeh palkon mein Kuch [Em]baate hai,        [C]Tere bina, tere bi [G]na
Adhuri [G]si, saari raa [Em]tein hain,        Tere [C]bina, tera bi [G]na
Aur aasma [D]mein Jo taare [Em]hai,        Tu waise mere [C]Dil mein sajha [G]hai
Ye taare [D]jo Ab tootay [Em]toh,        In khwahishon me [C]Tu hi raha [G]hai
[G]Aur mishri si Tere [Em]baatein yeh,        Yun [C]haule haule Yaad aa [G]rahi hai
[G]Aur meethi si Teri [Em]yaadein ab,        Yoon [C]raaton me Sula ja [G]rahin hai
Tu [D]aaj bhi Haan [Em]aaj bhi,        Kahin na kahi [C]Sapno me raha [G]hai
Aur mishri [D]ke In baadalo [Em]mein,        Tu aaj bhi [C]Kahin pe chippa [G]hain
[G]Tu needon mein Band [Em]aakhon me,        Yun [C]haule haule Ladti zagadti [G]hai
[G]Na jane kyun Phir [Em]aake tu,        [C]Muze hi jaana Kas ke pakadti [G]hain
[D]Tera, tera [Em]hi Mai [C]ho gaya hoon,        Sonay ke mehelon [G]mein
[D]Tera, tera [Em]hi Main [C]ho gaya ho,        Mitti ke shehron [G]mein
